RG DS OS: the Anbernic Home key reports KEY_HOME instead of BTN_Z

RG DS Core (like the stock firmware) treats KEY_HOME as the Home key: the in-game menu's Home route, and the bridge
keeps it from the game. BTN_Z is a gamepad button nothing maps.

--- a/rk3568-anbernic-rg-ds.dts	2026-10-27 09:00:00
+++ b/rk3568-anbernic-rg-ds.dts	2026-10-27 09:00:00
@@ -34,7 +34,7 @@
 
 		button-home {
 			label = "HOME";
-			linux,code = <BTN_Z>;
+			linux,code = <KEY_HOME>;
 			press-threshold-microvolt = <41000>;
 		};
 	};
